WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.134 line:92%
-Can I shout out, right away,

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
give you a shout out
on something I enjoyed seeing?

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:05.005 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I won't stop you.
-You're on the cover

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:07.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
of the "GQ" Comedy Issue!
Look at you!

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.074 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:11.011
Issa Rae, Sarah Silverman,
our friend Kate McKinnon.

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, pretty cool to be
with those two gals.

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:15.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's nice.
-And it's a very funny cover,

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:18.551
because there's like, extra
limbs where there shouldn't be.

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:19.085 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:20.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, because remember
when that happened?

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:22.789 size:78% position:39%
-Yeah, there -- yeah.
-So they kind of --

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:26.159 align:start size:94% position:6%
we did that, but they --
these two actually

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:27.827 align:start size:94% position:6%
were in a different room
when we shot this,

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:31.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
so it was stranger number one
and stranger number two.

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:34.634
And they were, like, okay,
now put your leg on her head.

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:35.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, funny.
-And now stick your legs

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:41.274
through her leg and then put
your hands up on to her thing.

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:42.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, wow.

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:44.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So I got pretty close.
-And that's great.

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:47.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
-With strangers one and two.
Hey, guys.

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:48.481 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:51.651
-You got to take a photo --
there's a photo shoot inside

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:53.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
where you have --
took a picture with an iguana,

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.121 align:start size:94% position:6%
a live iguana.
-Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:57.424
-And you had -- is it true
that you had a pet iguana

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.893
growing up?
-No, I'm no stranger to iguanas.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:00.927 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:04.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had one from the years
15 to 16.

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:05.565
-That seems like a short period
of time.

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:10.170
-Well, you know, they're not
meant to live in suburban homes.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:15.175
And they're even less meant to
participate in photo shoots.

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:16.009 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:21.881
The guy was, like, "We've got
the iguana, her name's Angela.

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:23.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm going to place Angela
on you.

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:25.118 line:92%
Don't worry. They don't bite."

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:27.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's not true.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:30.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause I've been bitten by one
for 20 minutes once.

00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:32.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, so he didn't realize
he was dealing with

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:36.329 align:start size:94% position:6%
the rarest case of a cover --
a cover shoot model

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:38.565 align:start size:94% position:6%
who had actually owned
an iguana.

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:40.033 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Right, exactly.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.668 size:81% position:41% line:92%
But he was just, like,

00:01:41.668 --> 00:01:44.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Angela, Angela,
look at the camera.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:44.904 size:75% position:38% line:92%
What are you doing?"

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:46.306 line:92%
He would take the iguana aside,

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:49.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Listen, baby,
they need to see your face.

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:51.244 align:start size:94% position:6%
Why don't you look
at the camera?"

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:52.145 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:54.147 line:92%
It's an iguana. That's why.

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:57.150
-It's great when you have --
sometimes I've been on sets

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.418 line:92%
where animal handlers show up,

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:00.520
and you think they're gonna
be like horse whisperers.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
That they're going get
whatever animal they handle

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:04.190 line:92%
to do the perfect things.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:04.991 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And then they do exactly

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:06.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
what you or I would do,
and be like,

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:09.229 size:78% position:39% line:92%
"Come on! Just do it!

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:11.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't worry,
I know how to talk to horses.

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.399 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do it!"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:16.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Angela, don't climb.
Don't climb up her.

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:18.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're very safe.
They're very safe."

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:20.006 line:92%
An iguana's got talons, okay?

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:22.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
An iguana can rip flesh open.

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:26.012
-I had the most wonderful thing
happen.

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:26.846 line:92%
We were at a wedding together.

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.381 size:81% position:41%
We were at our friend
Aidy Bryant's wedding.

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:29.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
She married Conner O'Malley,
also our friend.

00:02:29.616 --> 00:02:31.451
-It was the best wedding.
-It was a great wedding,

00:02:31.451 --> 00:02:32.218 line:92%
we sat next to each other.

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:35.788
And I gave you some advice,
and you actually took it.

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:38.057
-Yeah, well, you worked --
I was complaining to you

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:40.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I don't ever have time
to workout.

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:43.563 align:start size:94% position:6%
Time or the will, or impetus.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:46.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you were, like,
"well, I jog to work."

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:48.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I do.
-And when your workout

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:50.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
is your commute,
that saves a lot of time.

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:53.373
And I thought,
"Well, I'm going to do it, too."

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:56.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I've been running to work
for the past three weeks.

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:58.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
I did it every day.
-And it's working out.

00:02:58.611 --> 00:03:00.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-What's the difference?

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:03.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The key thing
that you mentioned to me,

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:06.019
but sort of glossed over
was that you have a shower

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:07.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
in your dressing room.
-Yeah.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Right.

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:12.525 line:92%
So I have been "showering"

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:15.261 line:92%
with a couple paper towels.

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:16.262 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:18.298 line:92%
Wet paper towels in the office

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:20.400 line:92%
that I share with Aidy Bryant.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.434 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.434 --> 00:03:23.403 line:92%
And, gosh, I'm just praying,

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:26.406
'cause one of these days,
she's just going to walk in

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:28.007 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and find me like --

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:32.745 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:34.147 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-No one wants that.

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:35.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No one wants it.
I don't want it.

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:37.417 size:81% position:41% line:92%
She doesn't want that.

